SUMMARY:Melodies and Memories
DESCRIPTION:A voice that deserves to be celebrated across generations\, Melodies & Memories is a thoughtfully curated tribute to the extraordinary life and musical legacy of legendary playback singer Suman Kalyanpur. This evening is an immersive journey through the songs\, stories and memories that defined one of Indian cinema’s most graceful and enduring voices. \nInterwoven with live performances are engaging anecdotes\, little-known facts and fascinating insights into the people\, collaborations and moments that shaped her career. Blending scholarship with nostalgia\, the programme offers audiences an opportunity to rediscover Suman Kalyanpur’s timeless contribution to Indian film music. \nSupported by: \n    \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nA Tribute to Suman Kalyanpur\nRSVPs will open on Sun\, Aug 23 at 5pm.\n*Performers*: Prateek Chatterjee & Madhuvanti Chowdhury\, Samanvitha Sharma\, Govind Kurnool\, Srinivas Achar\n*Event Categories*: In Memory\, Music\, Performing Arts
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/melodies-and-memories/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:In Memory,Music,Performing Arts
